About ALAIKA &nbsp;

At ALAIKA, our vision is to build the future of Financial Services with &nbsp; three brands under one roof - Advisory (Strategy Consulting), Capital (Private Equity), Building (Company Builder). Right now, we are&nbsp;in the midst of&nbsp;building our trojan horse ALAIKA Advisory. &nbsp;

